/Events\nODL\nKKHSOU\nMOU\nA.L. Choudhury College\nJagan Nath Singh College\nMHCM Science College\nNotice\nAISHE\nGallery\nContact Us\nMore\nAdmin Login\nWebmail Login\nAcademic Cell\nThe Academic Cell of Sarada Charan Dey College stands as the nerve center of academic affairs, orchestrating a symphony of learning experiences for students and faculty alike. Charged with the responsibility of ensuring the smooth functioning of academic processes, the Academic Cell serves as a guiding light, illuminating the path towards educational excellence and innovation.\nAt Sarada Charan Dey College, the Academic Cell is entrusted with a multitude of responsibilities, ranging from curriculum design and implementation to student evaluation and academic support services. With a team of dedicated professionals at its helm, the Academic Cell works tirelessly to create a conducive environment for learning, fostering intellectual curiosity and critical thinking among students.\nOne of the key functions of the Academic Cell is to design and update the curriculum in alignment with the latest developments in the respective fields of study. By incorporating interdisciplinary perspectives and emerging trends, the Academic Cell ensures that students receive a well-rounded education that prepares them for the challenges of the future.\nIn addition to curriculum development, the Academic Cell oversees the conduct of examinations, ensuring fairness, transparency, and integrity in the evaluation process. Through meticulous planning and execution, the Academic Cell strives to uphold the highest standards of academic rigor and excellence, while also providing necessary support services to students to help them excel in their academic pursuits.\nFurthermore, the Academic Cell serves as a hub for academic research and collaboration, facilitating opportunities for faculty members and students to engage in scholarly activities and knowledge dissemination. By fostering a culture of academic inquiry and innovation, the Academic Cell plays a crucial role in shaping the intellectual landscape of Sarada Charan Dey College, empowering individuals to realize their full potential and make meaningful contributions to society.\nAcademic Cell Members\nSl. No\nName\nDesignation\nDepartment\n1\nDr. Tumpa Bhattacharjee\nCoordinator\nAsstt. Prof. ( Deptt. of Economics)\n2\nMr. Abul Hussain Mazumder\nMember\n(Asstt. Prof. Deptt. Of Pol Science.)\n3\nMrs. Suma Dey\nMember\nAsst. Prof (Deptt. Of Philosophy)\n4\nMr. Avishek Deb\nMember\nAsstt. Prof. ( Deptt. Of Eco.)\n5\nMr. Kanuj Purkayastha\nMember\nHead Asstt. Cum Accountant\ngo to home\nScan the QR to visit College Website\nIMPORTANT LINKS\nAssam University\nDirector of Higher Education\nRUSA\nNAAC\nAISHE\nUGC\nNVSP: Voter registration\nMy Gov\nContact Info\nSarada Charan Dey College\nAddress:\nKalinagar, Hailakandi, National Highway 37, Assam 788801\nPhone:\n+91-60021 00695\nEmail:\nscdeycollege@gmail.com\nOpens in your application\nFollow Us\nOur Visitor\nDesigned & Developed By: F.S.Enterprise Mobile:8638640830\n© Copyright:2024-\nSarada Charan Dey College", "links": [{"label": "Skip to content", "url": "https://scdck.ac.in/academic-cell/#main"}, {"label": "", "url": "https://scdck.ac.in"}, {"label": "Home", "url": "https://scdck.ac.in/"}, {"label": "About", "url": "https://scdck.ac.in/academic-cell/"}, {"label": "About the College", "url": "https://scdck.ac.in/about-the-college/"}, {"label": "Vission & Mission", "url": "https://scdck.ac.in/vission-mission/"}, {"label": "Code of Conduct", "url": "https://scdck.ac.in/code-of-conduct/"}, {"label": "Administration", "url": "https://scdck.ac.in/academic-cell/"}, {"label": "Principal Desk", "url": "https://scdck.ac.in/principal-desk/"}, {"label": "Governing Body", "url": "https://scdck.ac.in/governing-body/"}, {"label": "Non-Teaching Staff", "url": "https://scdck.ac.in/non-teaching-staff/"}, {"label": "Departments", "url": "https://scdck.ac.in/academic-cell/"}, {"label": "Benga